[0.0-2.8] caller: Hello, I'm calling from the Social Security Administration.
[3.4-4.9] elder: Yes?
[5.5-10.4] caller: Your social security number was used in a crime. We will suspend your benefits.
[11.0-12.5] elder: Oh dear.
[13.1-18.3] caller: To protect your money you need to move it to a safe account right now.
[18.9-20.4] elder: Which account?
[21.0-25.5] caller: I'll give you the details. Don't tell your bank, they may be involved.
